  "description": "The Freedom of Light. Our LYKE CF 11 represents this motto like no other eMTB in our line-up. This ultralight and nimble full-suspension eBike is the perfect partner for demanding trail riders – whether racing up steep inclines or flying down fast descents. The sporty carbon frame with a closed down tube, the compact Fazua Ride 60 motor placed in the seat tube, and the efficient, removable 480Wh battery contribute to shedding unnecessary weight. High-quality Shimano drivetrain and brake components, Fox suspension with 140mm of travel and specifically designed kinematics ensure optimal ePerformance both uphill and downhill. And with DT Swiss 29″ wheels and grippy Maxxis tyres, you’ll roll like a pro – even on rough terrain. Hop on the new LYKE CF 11 and experience the boundless lightness of a modern light eMTB on every trail.",
